[{"title":"次韵写怀送叔贞之成都十七首 其二","author":"方孝孺","text":"盛世岂无谋国者，汉家长忆富民侯。\n荣名史策寻常事，公论江河万古流。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58247,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵写怀送叔贞之成都十七首 其三","author":"方孝孺","text":"汉高嫚士千馀载，不见师臣与友臣。\n解使时君谦德重，孔明而下两三人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58248,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵写怀送叔贞之成都十七首 其四","author":"方孝孺","text":"下士立身泾渭浑，胸中耿耿是非存。\n子云美新最可贱，著作犹尊李仲元。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58249,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵写怀送叔贞之成都十七首 其五","author":"方孝孺","text":"密叶丛篁噪晚鸦，荒村百里两三家。\n疲民采拾供租税，犹恐傍人议榷茶。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58250,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵写怀送叔贞之成都十七首 其六","author":"方孝孺","text":"多才久要钱文学，长日诗筒衮衮来。\n俊思雪消三峡长，好怀春到百花开。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58251,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵写怀送叔贞之成都十七首 其七","author":"方孝孺","text":"伯尚庭前倾竹叶，用中宅畔看梅花。\n天教二子相为乐，来往风流也足誇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58252,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵写怀送叔贞之成都十七首 其八","author":"方孝孺","text":"每怀樗散郑司户，喜看?梓作孙枝。\n气清似得江山助，才异休令匠石疑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58253,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵写怀送叔贞之成都十七首 其九","author":"方孝孺","text":"胡生挟策行千里，足茧衣穿不肯回。\n斯道要为终古计，丈夫宁避俗人猜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58254,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵写怀送叔贞之成都十七首 其十","author":"方孝孺","text":"江山万里无黄耳，雨露三年忆紫荆。\n日暮出门闻雁过，忍听云畔索群声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58255,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵写怀送叔贞之成都十七首 其十一","author":"方孝孺","text":"一念无为付道耕，百邪还听敛心兵。\n本原能与天同体，三代功名始可成。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58256,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵写怀送叔贞之成都十七首 其十二","author":"方孝孺","text":"浩荡乾坤烂熳春，天将乐意付穷人。\n迥无臭味堪誇世，纵有争心岂解嗔。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58257,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵写怀送叔贞之成都十七首 其十三","author":"方孝孺","text":"乌石冈头白苧衣，几回醉伴夕阳归。\n山中兄弟遥相忆，未必天心与我违。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58258,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵写怀送叔贞之成都十七首 其十四","author":"方孝孺","text":"我与东风作主宾，忍教负却太平春。\n一觞一咏酬佳景，也未输他世上人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58259,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵写怀送叔贞之成都十七首 其十五","author":"方孝孺","text":"梅径桃蹊绕荜门，半依城市半通村。\n春风一见如相识，莫逆于心两不言。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58260,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵写怀送叔贞之成都十七首 其十六","author":"方孝孺","text":"鱼在深渊鸟在山，乾坤无物不相关。\n野亭日午攴颐坐，闲看云天一鹤还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58261,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵写怀送叔贞之成都十七首 其十七","author":"方孝孺","text":"食罢移床坐小亭，细看群蚁夺馀腥。\n倦来莞尔成微笑，宇宙茫茫几废兴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58262,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"别母舅哭外舅郑公 其一","author":"方孝孺","text":"昔奉安车共入关，拟于此路复南还。\n今朝独向江东去，泪洒西风草树斑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58263,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"别母舅哭外舅郑公 其二","author":"方孝孺","text":"女甥携抱远相从，骨肉情深反负公。\n南郑江头三尺冢，夕阳衰草万山中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58264,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"别母舅哭外舅郑公 其三","author":"方孝孺","text":"竹帛相期古道深，结婚端不为多金。\n自惭非是奇男子，恐负侯高择婿心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58265,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"中秋对月 其一","author":"方孝孺","text":"双橹鸣江水不波，云山无数拂船过。\n夜深把酒问明月，月色与愁谁较多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58266,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"中秋对月 其二","author":"方孝孺","text":"南郑荒坟草木寒，东瓯旧宅桂花丹。\n九秋最好今宵月，又向孤舟独自看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58267,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题汉中三寺佛放光","author":"方孝孺","text":"三寺神灯古有名，我来惟见月华清。\n非关佛日今消歇，应避文星不敢明。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58268,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"蜀相像","author":"方孝孺","text":"羽扇纶巾一卧龙，誓匡宝祚剪奸雄。\n图开八阵神机外，国定三分掌握中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58269,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"买臣妻墓","author":"方孝孺","text":"青草池边一故丘，千年埋骨不埋羞。\n丁宁嘱付人间妇，自古糟糠合到头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58270,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"二乔观书","author":"方孝孺","text":"深闺睡起读兵书，窈窕丰姿若个谁。\n千古周南风化本，晚凉何不诵关雎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58271,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"王节妇","author":"方孝孺","text":"两月孤儿百里坟，一灯风雨几黄昏。\n可怜玉帐豪华客，不识金沙节义门。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58272,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"郑义门","author":"方孝孺","text":"丹诏旌门巳拜嘉，千年盛典实堪誇。\n史臣何用春秋笔，天子亲书孝义门。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58273,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"彭山道中","author":"方孝孺","text":"烟鸟归林巳夕阳，野人相引度高冈。\n马头一片青山影，经过絺衣似水凉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58274,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜度桑洲驿","author":"方孝孺","text":"山路弯弯石甃平，碧天凉露下三更。\n无端一夜西风恶，吹着新愁上紫荆。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58275,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"客至","author":"方孝孺","text":"竹里烹茶费屡呼，携壶沽酒绕村无。\n同餐麦饭无难色，风槩知非浅丈夫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58276,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻卢原质表兄廷试探花郎授编脩喜而寄之","author":"方孝孺","text":"奉天殿上榜初开，共贺江南得秀才。\n好是青萝居士说，近来文运属天台。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58277,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送义乌龚叔安给事归省 其一","author":"方孝孺","text":"鸡舌同含侍紫宸，朝回东阁每相亲。\n片帆忽逐西风去，鸳鹭行中少一人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58278,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送义乌龚叔安给事归省 其二","author":"方孝孺","text":"绣湖烟雨正宜秋，之子还家喜得游。\n忠孝堂前旧明月，相随重到凤池头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58279,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"谈诗 其一","author":"方孝孺","text":"举世皆宗李杜诗，不知李杜更宗谁。\n能探风雅无穷意，始是乾坤绝妙词。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58280,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"谈诗 其三","author":"方孝孺","text":"发挥道德乃成文，枝叶何曾离本根。\n末俗竞工繁缛体，千秋精意与谁论。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58281,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"谈诗 其五","author":"方孝孺","text":"万古乾坤此道存，前无端绪后无垠。\n手操北斗调元气，散作桑麻雨露恩。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58282,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"览陈先生见和诸诗戏题","author":"方孝孺","text":"孔璋挥翰檄曹公，烈日秋霜格力雄。\n白发云孙千载后，新诗尚可愈头风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58283,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"道者扇","author":"方孝孺","text":"竞利争名不暂休，纷纷尽逐水东流。\n道人心事如松柏，阅尽寻常草木秋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58284,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题山水隐者","author":"方孝孺","text":"栋宇参差逼翠微，路通犹恐世人知。\n等闲识得东风面，卧看白云初起时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58285,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题山水","author":"方孝孺","text":"霜落江南木叶丹，滔天波浪一舟还。\n何人得似林中叟，目送浮云过远山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58286,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"脩德惠枯木图次韵 其一","author":"方孝孺","text":"远别出门愁见难，燕山越水路盘盘。\n将心付与天边月，两地清宵一样看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58287,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"脩德惠枯木图次韵 其二","author":"方孝孺","text":"月明树影落晴波，写寄山房古意多。\n巳分此身同槁木，岁寒相对老岩阿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58288,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"脩德惠枯木图次韵 其三","author":"方孝孺","text":"百年礼乐愧前贤，濂洛微言久不传。\n待子归来同讲习，细炊麦饭饮寒泉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58289,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b0